WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.080
¿Qué?

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.520
Gina, your mother

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.160
is Tiffany Gellahar.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:07.640
Her husband was

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.120
the boss of a mafia gang

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.320
that operated illegal coal mines.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:15.480
This is ridiculous.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:19.000
When he was killed,

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:20.840
your mother fled the city.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:21.600
She changed both

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.000
her and your names and

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.240
and listed herself

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.600
as your grandmother.

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:27.360
She thought it would

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:28.760
protect you from the...

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:30.640
ghosts of her past.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:32.920
So you're...

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.080
actually saying that

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:35.960
that my grandmother is-

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:37.240
Your mother.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:39.840
She's the closest

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:41.200
family you ever had.
